#. 自分の事で精一杯なの…
#. 他人に構ってる余裕はないわ。
msgctxt "0001 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I have to put all my energy into watching out for\n"
"myself. I don't have time to worry about anyone else."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0002 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Kyoko"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. 霧切さんを誘ってみようか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I talk to Kyoko for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …私と一緒にいたいの？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "...You want to spend time with me?"
msgstr ""

#. でも、私から話せる事なんてないわよ？
#. それでもいいの？
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"But I don't have anything to say. Are you okay with\n"
"that?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>無言の霧切さんと一緒に過ごした。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I spent some time with Kyoko in silence...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0009 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Kyoko a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
